# FORBIDDEN — npm is the ONLY distribution path (PREVENT-DIST-001).
# Never produce or commit a `.tgz` (`npm pack`); tarballs bypass pi's package
# manager and don't propagate to other devices. `npm publish` only.
*.tgz

